namari you've defeated lots of dragons before

289
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:17,340
that right

290
00:13:17,340 --> 00:13:18,980
sure have

291
00:13:18,980 --> 00:13:20,380
then

292
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:21,480
can you

293
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:24,960
please namari

294
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:26,880
can you rejoin the party

295
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:28,800
what's all this

296
00:13:28,800 --> 00:13:30,720
work together with laos

297
00:13:30,720 --> 00:13:32,100
and defeat the red dragon

298
00:13:32,100 --> 00:13:33,620
no matter the cost

299
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:35,180
we need to save fallon

300
00:13:35,180 --> 00:13:36,780
just this once

301
00:13:36,780 --> 00:13:39,020
i'll get the money to pay you somehow

302
00:13:39,020 --> 00:13:40,180
stop it marsil

303
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:42,180
but why

304
00:13:42,180 --> 00:13:44,640
the adventurer circle's tight-knit

305
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:47,360
so rumors spread around faster than you can blink

306
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:51,180
in fact i bet you heard that namari was struggling with money

307
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:52,520
isn't that right

308
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:54,080
mr tonsil

309
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,080
yes

310
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:59,120
so if she rejoins her former party to make a quick buck

311
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:03,620
she'll gain a reputation as someone who will do anything you ask her to if you pay her enough

312
00:14:03,620 --> 00:14:06,780
i don't think it'll prevent her from getting jobs but

313
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:09,360
the type of clients she'll get will change

314
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:11,980
it's best for everyone

315
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:14,460
if you give up on trying to get her to return

316
00:14:14,460 --> 00:14:17,280
you heard the man marsil

317
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:19,580
you should go back too

318
00:14:19,580 --> 00:14:27,760
no

319
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:29,960
i can recover my mana

320
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:33,640
and i'm going to use the undine to do it

321
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:34,180
huh

322
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:35,280
how so

323
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:37,860
i'll catch it and

324
00:14:37,860 --> 00:14:39,540
drink it

325
00:14:39,540 --> 00:14:41,700
wait

326
00:14:41,700 --> 00:14:42,480
really

327
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:45,060
what's with that reaction

328
00:14:45,060 --> 00:14:46,660
where's your usual enthusiasm

329
00:14:46,660 --> 00:14:49,000
i don't have much interest in spirits

330
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,580
okay but they eat mana to live

331
00:14:51,580 --> 00:14:54,920
so i have no doubt they're completely filled with this stuff

332
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:58,560
catching it is probably going to be harder than killing it

333
00:14:58,560 --> 00:15:00,220
let's see

334
00:15:00,220 --> 00:15:02,080
water spirits are weak to heat

335
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,980
so if we take advantage of that

336
00:15:03,980 --> 00:15:06,500
maybe we could attack it with a heated sword

337
00:15:06,500 --> 00:15:09,560
or we could spill some oil

338
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:11,540
and corner it on the fiery lake

339
00:15:11,540 --> 00:15:16,560
then after we attack it and it splatters onto the floor

340
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:17,760
i'll slurp it all up

341
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:21,840
wouldn't it punch holes in your body from the inside

342
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,760
yeah you're right

343
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:25,860
there must be a way

344
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:27,460
just think

345
00:15:27,460 --> 00:15:36,040
if we heat this pan and use it as a shield then we can attack and defend

346
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:38,220
that spirit destroyed stone pillars

347
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:40,240
what's a shoddy pan gonna do

348
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,680
how dare you call it shoddy

349
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:48,680
this is a family heirloom that's been very well taken care of for multiple generations

350
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:51,720
it never burns and evenly distributes heat

351
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,380
it's the perfect pan

352
00:15:53,380 --> 00:15:55,440
whoa wait a sec

353
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:58,080
this color

354
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,440
this shine

355
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,600
this weight

356
00:16:00,600 --> 00:16:01,980
this feel

357
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:04,300
it's adamantine isn't it

358
00:16:04,300 --> 00:16:05,620
unbelievable

359
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:08,720
as a weapon this can smash through dragon bones

360
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,980
as armor it can block a dragon's fangs

361
00:16:10,980 --> 00:16:14,040
adamantine is what blacksmiths dream about

362
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:16,480
why was it turned into a pan

363
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:19,940
it started as a shield but it was useless to me like that

364
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:22,340
are you kidding me that's such a waste

365
00:16:22,340 --> 00:16:24,220
can it hold up against an undine

366
00:16:24,220 --> 00:16:25,560
of course it can

367
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:27,740
since we have both a pan and a lid

368
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:29,080
two of us can take one

369
00:16:29,080 --> 00:16:30,900
trap the undine inside

370
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:33,400
and then put it over a fire and kill it

371
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:35,360
that's the only way

372
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:40,160
even if the shield is sturdy the undine might be too powerful

373
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:42,760
that dwarf might be fine

374
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:44,900
but will lios be able to hold it down

375
00:16:44,900 --> 00:16:52,680
when the surface warps raise the pan

376
00:16:52,680 --> 00:16:55,760
try not to spill anything

377
00:16:55,760 --> 00:17:00,240
heads up

378
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:13,360
it's so powerful

379
00:17:13,360 --> 00:17:22,100
lios

380
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:34,020
namori

381
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:47,760
no

382
00:17:47,760 --> 00:17:56,480
all right

383
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,480
that's it

384
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,240
we got this

385
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:01,240
on the fire

386
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:01,840
now

387
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:27,800
yes you did it

388
00:18:27,800 --> 00:18:30,440
amazing truly barbaric strength

389
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:31,840
namari

390
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:34,020
thank you so much

391
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:35,420
you too lios

392
00:18:35,420 --> 00:18:36,880
are you okay

393
00:18:36,880 --> 00:18:39,240
their stature would make you think otherwise

394
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:41,240
but tall men are actually weak

395
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,480
oh yeah

396
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:53,700
you don't have to chug it that fast

397
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:56,360
i want to make sure i absorb the spirit's mana

398
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:58,340
don't you know

399
00:18:58,340 --> 00:19:02,340
eating foods that help with absorption is the basics of nutrition

400
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:03,140
so does that

401
00:19:03,140 --> 00:19:04,080
so does that mean

402
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:06,520
let's get cooking

403
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:10,560
potatoes carrots onions

404
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:12,780
peel the skin from the tentacles

405
00:19:12,780 --> 00:19:14,780
and roughly chop them

406
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:17,880
salt and pepper the kelpie meat

407
00:19:17,880 --> 00:19:20,140
put the meat in a pan

408
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:21,260
and when it's browned

409
00:19:21,260 --> 00:19:23,500
add in the onions and carrots and fry them

410
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:25,700
add that to the undine

411
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:29,360
make sure to skim off the scum

412
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:31,200
then add potatoes and herbs

413
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,940
and let it simmer

414
00:19:32,940 --> 00:19:42,380
it's ready

415
00:19:42,380 --> 00:19:45,960
huh

416
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:47,120
where'd they go

417
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:50,020
they went on over to the other tower to examine it

418
00:19:50,020 --> 00:19:51,880
we're back

419
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:54,720
who knew there would be so many of them

420
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:56,920
i'm glad we managed to clear them out

421
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:57,520
um

422
00:19:57,520 --> 00:19:58,480
hey

423
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:00,940
would you

424
00:20:00,940 --> 00:20:03,040
