428
00:20:12,780 --> 00:20:15,920
yeah but i had sent you around to help me out

429
00:20:15,920 --> 00:20:17,720
here you go nomari

430
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:21,820
don't worry about serving it

431
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:22,680
hurry up and eat

432
00:20:22,680 --> 00:20:23,140
oh

433
00:20:23,140 --> 00:20:23,960
right

434
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:38,860
it's working

435
00:20:38,860 --> 00:20:41,200
a little bit of my mana came back

436
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,920
so

437
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:46,800
you've been cooking monsters you find here this whole time

438
00:20:46,800 --> 00:20:48,100
yeah pretty much

439
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:52,200
i was prepared to get criticized for leaving the party but

440
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:55,820
i never thought i'd have to see them in this kind of situation

441
00:20:55,820 --> 00:20:59,020
this must be some form of punishment

442
00:20:59,020 --> 00:21:05,960
yum

443
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:08,040
everything's so rich

444
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:10,660
