447
00:21:14,180 --> 00:21:17,260
hey your name's senshi yeah

448
00:21:17,260 --> 00:21:19,800
i uh apologize

449
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:22,480
for insulting your axe

450
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:24,980
it's fine

451
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:29,180
i got no interest in fortune so it's not like i'm gonna fix it

452
00:21:29,180 --> 00:21:36,080
some old buddies i had would always get on my case for not being able to tell the difference between oars

453
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:38,340
nomari

454
00:21:38,340 --> 00:21:40,820
we will be returning to the surface

455
00:21:40,820 --> 00:21:45,040
you're free to stay here if you want to

456
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:48,060
wait seriously

457
00:21:48,060 --> 00:21:50,680
you've got to at least stay to try this

458
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:53,080
the texture is kind of weird but it's still pretty good

459
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:53,900
uh

460
00:21:53,900 --> 00:21:56,800
i can't really ask you to trust me

461
00:21:56,800 --> 00:22:00,240
this isn't about money for me

462
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:03,280
i really want to become a member of your party

463
00:22:03,280 --> 00:22:06,660
i promise to do my best

464
00:22:06,660 --> 00:22:18,760
you know chill chuck

465
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:20,280
i'm surprised

466
00:22:20,280 --> 00:22:22,700
i thought you'd be the first to leave the group for sure

467
00:22:22,700 --> 00:22:24,760
i didn't see you as the type

468
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:26,480
to take on an unpaid job

469
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:30,240
well yeah i only take jobs that pay me up front

470
00:22:30,240 --> 00:22:32,700
though it gets kind of tricky

471
00:22:32,700 --> 00:22:34,540
since i can't leave when i wanna

472
00:22:34,540 --> 00:22:37,440
huh you're only here because it's a job

473
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,400
it's not because of friendship or anything

474
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:41,380
listen marcel

475
00:22:41,380 --> 00:22:43,140
here's something you should know

476
00:22:43,140 --> 00:22:46,360
anybody who tells you they don't need a reward

477
00:22:46,360 --> 00:22:49,240
are honestly the people you should trust the least

478
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:51,240
oh by the way

479
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:52,440
what's shuru up to

480
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:56,460
don't know seemed like he had some other plans cooked up

481
00:22:56,460 --> 00:22:59,340
he was so in love with fallon he wanted to propose

482
00:22:59,340 --> 00:23:02,040
so i'm willing to bet he's looking for her

483
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:04,400
huh seriously

484
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:05,600
so dense

485
00:23:05,600 --> 00:23:06,220
yep

486
00:23:06,220 --> 00:23:07,820
all right everyone

487
00:23:07,820 --> 00:23:10,680
i know fallon's special to you

488
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:13,680
but i hope you make it back okay

489
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:14,780
huh

490
00:23:14,780 --> 00:23:18,080
same to you namari

491
00:23:18,080 --> 00:23:27,200
see ya

492
00:23:27,200 --> 00:23:27,240
see ya

493
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:57,220
Thank you.

